  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 25
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "And she gave me a hug, too.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 27
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "Bet. I got you Friday.",
  "para_end": true,
  "in_line": false,
  "idx": 31
 },
 {
  "kind": "dre",
  "text": "A Friday. They come every week.",
